86u|v|To censure; to express disapprobation of; to find fault with; to reproach. ; To bring reproach upon; to blemish. ; An expression of disapprobation fir something deemed to be wrong; imputation of fault; censure. ; That which is deserving of censure or disapprobation; culpability; fault; crime; sin. ; Hurt; injury.	o:1g10,44,5~1g10,44,5	d:1psw,29,4~1psw,29,4
86u|a|To censure; to express disapprobation of; to find fault with; to reproach. ; To bring reproach upon; to blemish. ; An expression of disapprobation fir something deemed to be wrong; imputation of fault; censure. ; That which is deserving of censure or disapprobation; culpability; fault; crime; sin. ; Hurt; injury.	j:hk7,51,1~hk7,51,1
