8d3|n|Something blunt and round; a small drop or lump of something viscid or thick; a drop; a bubble; a blister. ; A small fresh-water fish (Uranidea Richardsoni); the miller's thumb.	a:zic,59,3;1xqa,49,3;7sf,48,4;1x8n,36,3~7sf,48,4;1x8n,36,3;1xqa,49,3;zic,59,3	v:1mw3,73,13~1mw3,73,13	V:tnx,86,3~tnx,86,3
